{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iRtIZmzh5g1792721795.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價連跌三天，見近兩周低位。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.718，較上個交易日下調30點子，是自10月23日以來的低位。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價早段於6.67水平上落。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展2,575億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作。扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨回籠5,145億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:06:25.556350+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T02:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:37.511807+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T02:59:49.371520+00:00","content_hash":"849f4fdd51a6f1e4cc9f77055936b2f0e2cce004a48f9e2bb4c2ec26de160b4d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}